OL,3,GNEWSAMachete attacker tackled in pizza 
OL,4,Atakeaway                               
OL,6,FStaff at a pizza takeaway showed       
OL,7,F"immense courage" in tackling and      
OL,8,Fdisarming an machete-wielding attacker,
OL,9,Fpolice have said.                      
OL,11,FCCTV footage from Pizzarella in Turbary
OL,12,FRoad, Ferndown, Dorset showed the      
OL,13,Fmoment Alexander Livick, 41, walked    
OL,14,Fbehind the counter and threatened staff
OL,15,Flate on 22 June.                       
OL,17,FHe was restrained and disarmed by two  
OL,18,Fworkers and was later arrested by a    
OL,19,Fpolice dog unit.                       
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
